<title>USA: American Medserve acquires pharmacy.</title>
<headline>American Medserve acquires pharmacy.</headline>
<dateline>NAPERVILLE, Ill. 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Medserve Corp said Thursday its newly formed AMC-Tennessee Inc unit acquired Stephens Drugs Inc, an institutional pharmacy in Hermitage, Tenn.</p>
<p>Financial terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>The company said Stephens, which provides pharmaceutical care to about 2,600 residents in long-term care facilities in Tennessee, has more than $2.7 million in annual revenues.</p>
<p>American Medserve provides pharmaceuticals to long-term care and assisted living facilities. The stock was up 5/8 at 15 in afternoon trading.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
